            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# LighTxt 1.3

- Redesigned CSV filters with per-column controls, clear active-filter chips, and one-click reset.
- Added a fast unique-value picker with search, exact multi-select, and bounded scanning for large CSV files.
- Added right-click row and column actions for inserting and deleting rows or columns, alongside sorting, filtering, and column summaries.
]]></description>
